    "message": "test(hepta): align refusal namespace fixture with Cell scope\n\nThe stable scope digest excludes run_id, so changing only the run must keep the canonical refusal slot. Check that the complete target binding still rejects a different run, and change cell_id for the genuine missing-namespace control.\n\nRetain the physical missing-file, original-byte restoration, writer epoch and real Armed/Ready controls. Add caller location to the missing-file assertion for precise failure diagnosis. Production code and policy are unchanged.",
